Add support for spice-direct console types.

This patch adds support for Nova microversion 2.98 which exposes the new
spice-direct console type and the pre-existing /os-console-auth-token/ API.

+----------+----------------------------------------------------------+
| Field    | Value                                                    |
+----------+----------------------------------------------------------+
| protocol | spice                                                    |
| type     | spice-direct                                             |
| url      | http://127.0.0.1:13002/nova?token=f78009fb-41ad-...      |
+----------+----------------------------------------------------------+

+----------------------+--------------------------------------+
| Field                | Value                                |
+----------------------+--------------------------------------+
| host                 | 127.0.0.1                            |
| instance_uuid        | f2477018-aa93-...                    |
| internal_access_path | None                                 |
| port                 | 5900                                 |
| tls_port             | 5901                                 |
+----------------------+--------------------------------------+

Depends-On: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/nova/+/924844